   7:   Trial registered with ANZCTR ACTRN12618001268235 (NOT CT.gov) â†’ synthetic LEGACY-ANZCTR-12618001268235-FCM key.
   8: 
   9: Topic 19 - PREGNANCY_HIV_VESTED_REVIEW.html: Lockman 2021 Lancet HIV â€” IMPAACT 2010 / VESTED.
  10:   3-arm phase 3 RCT. NCT03048422. n=643 across Botswana, South Africa (4 sites), Tanzania,
  11:   Uganda, Zimbabwe (3 sites), India, Brazil (4 sites), Thailand (3 sites), USA (2 sites).
  12:   Predominantly sub-Saharan Africa (~70%). Arms: DTG+FTC/TAF vs DTG+FTC/TDF vs EFV/FTC/TDF
  13:   during pregnancy + postpartum. PRIMARY: maternal viral suppression at delivery + adverse
  14:   pregnancy outcome composite + maternal grade â‰¥3 AE + infant grade â‰¥3 AE. Drove WHO 2021
  15:   guideline preference for DTG-based ART in pregnancy.
  16: """
  17: from __future__ import annotations
  18: from pathlib import Path
  19: 
  20: def replace_realdata(text, new_body):
  21:     start = text.find("realData: {")
  22:     body_start = text.find("{", start)
  23:     depth = 0; i = body_start; body_end = body_start
  24:     while i < len(text):
  25:         c = text[i]
  26:         if c == "{": depth += 1
  27:         elif c == "}": depth -= 1
  28:         if depth == 0 and i > body_start: body_end = i; break
  29:         i += 1
  30:     return text[:body_start] + "{" + new_body + text[body_end+1:]
  31: 
  32: 
  33: def replace_or_die(text, old, new):
  34:     if old not in text:
  35:         raise SystemExit(f"old string not found: {old[:80]!r}...")
  36:     return text.replace(old, new)
