  62:                     snippet: 'Source: Pasricha SR, Mwangi MN, Moya E, et al. Ferric carboxymaltose versus standard-of-care oral iron to treat second-trimester anaemia in Malawian pregnant women: a randomised controlled trial. Lancet 2023;401:1595-1609. PMID 37088092. DOI 10.1016/S0140-6736(23)00278-7. ANZCTR ACTRN12618001268235.',
